### 🚀 SHIPZY API - Complete Implementation Tests
### Test all 25 endpoints across all modules

### ================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION TESTS (3 endpoints)
### ================================================

### 1.1 Verify Firebase Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/firebase/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN

{
  "idToken": "your_firebase_id_token_here",
  "deviceId": "test-device-123"
}

### 1.2 Refresh Access Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "your_refresh_token_here"
}

### 1.3 Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "deviceId": "test-device-123"
}

### ================================================
### 2. USERS MODULE TESTS (5 endpoints)
### ================================================

### 2.1 Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 2.2 Update User Profile
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "fullName": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com"
}

### 2.3 Get User Addresses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 2.4 Save New Address
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me/addresses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "addressType": "home",
  "label": "My Home",
  "fullAddress": "123 Main Street, Downtown, City 12345",
  "building": "A1 Tower",
  "floor": "5th",
  "flatNumber": "501",
  "landmark": "Near Central Mall",
  "city": "New York",
  "state": "NY",
  "postalCode": "10001",
  "latitude": 40.7128,
  "longitude": -74.0060,
  "isDefault": true
}

### 2.5 Delete Address
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me/addresses/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ================================================
### 3. DRIVERS MODULE TESTS (6 endpoints)
### ================================================

### 3.1 Get Driver Profile
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 3.2 Update Driver Profile
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "fullName": "Driver Smith Updated",
  "email": "driver.smith.updated@example.com"
}

### 3.3 Update Driver Availability
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me/availability
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "isAvailable": true,
  "isOnline": true
}

### 3.4 Update Driver Location
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me/location
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "latitude": 40.7589,
  "longitude": -73.9851
}

### 3.5 Get Active Assignments
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me/assignments
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 3.6 Get Driver Earnings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/drivers/me/earnings
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### ================================================
### 4. ORDERS MODULE TESTS (8 endpoints)
### ================================================

### 4.1 Calculate Fare Estimate
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/calculate-fare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryTypeId": 1,
  "distanceKm": 5.2,
  "weightKg": 2.5
}

### 4.2 Create New Order (Client)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer CLIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "deliveryTypeId": 1,
  "paymentMethodId": 1,
  "pickup": {
    "address": "123 Pickup Street, City",
    "latitude": 40.7128,
    "longitude": -74.0060,
    "city": "New York",
    "state": "NY",
    "postalCode": "10001",
    "contactName": "John Pickup",
    "contactPhone": "+1234567890"
  },
  "delivery": {
    "address": "456 Delivery Avenue, City",
    "latitude": 40.7589,
    "longitude": -73.9851,
    "city": "New York",
    "state": "NY",
    "postalCode": "10002",
    "contactName": "Jane Delivery",
    "contactPhone": "+0987654321"
  },
  "estimatedDistanceKm": 5.2,
  "packageDescription": "Electronics - Laptop",
  "packageWeightKg": 2.5,
  "specialInstructions": "Handle with care"
}

### 4.3 Get Order Details
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer CLIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4.4 List User's Orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer CLIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4.5 Get Available Orders (Driver)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/available?latitude=40.7128&longitude=-74.0060&radius=10&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4.6 Cancel Order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer CLIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "cancellationReason": "Changed my mind about the delivery"
}

### 4.7 Driver Accepts Order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4.8 Update Order Status (Driver)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "status": "picked_up"
}

