### ================================================
### 7. TEST VARIABLES (Replace with actual values)
### ================================================

@name Shipzy API Tests
@baseUrl http://localhost:3000

### Variables to replace:
### - YOUR_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN: Valid Firebase ID token
### - YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN: Valid JWT access token
### - YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN: Valid refresh token
### - DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN: JWT token for driver role
### - CLIENT_ACCESS_TOKEN: JWT token for client role

### ================================================
### USAGE INSTRUCTIONS:
### ================================================

### 1. Replace all placeholder tokens with real values
### 2. Use VS Code REST Client extension to run these tests
### 3. Tests are organized by module for easy debugging
### 4. All endpoints require proper authentication except static data
### 5. Static data endpoints are public and don't need auth headers
